.serena/cache/
# SpecStory: saves full chat transcripts into the repository
.specstory/
# Task Master AI: local state (tasks/ is a team decision)
# .taskmaster/

# ==================== Generic safety net ====================
# The ".local." infix is the de-facto convention for personal overrides
# across tools (Claude Code, ASP.NET appsettings, Vite, docker compose...).
*.local.json
*.local.md
*.local.toml
*.local.yml
*.local.yaml

# ==================== Keep the reverse direction committed ====================
# These files tell the AGENT what NOT to read (.env, keys, PII). They are the
# mirror image of .gitignore and must be shared with the team — never ignore:
# .aiignore  .cursorignore  .codexignore  .geminiignore  .clineignore
# .aiderignore  .rooignore  .kilocodeignore  .augmentignore

# Created by https://www.toptal.com/developers/gitignore/api/autohotkey
